# Naked headings

Heading styles live on the element in `@layer base` (`src/index.css`). Use **naked** `<h1>`–`<h6>` with no size, weight, or tracking utilities.

Pick the level that matches the intended scale; do not restyle a heading with `text-*` / `font-*` / `tracking-*` at the call site.

Only add utilities when the user explicitly asks for an exception (e.g. layout margin).

```tsx
// ✅
<h1>Schedule</h1>
<h4>Patients</h4>

// ❌
<h1 className="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">Schedule</h1>
```

See `design.md` → Typography → Headings.
